   "why": "Five dotted pink rings mark the predicted days on a 7-day strip, so the 2 days countdown and 1 pink button read as one forecast.",
   "html": "<div class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown\"><div class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__week\"><div class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__day\"><span class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__dow x-flo-cycle-countdown__dow--today\">TODAY</span><span class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__date x-flo-cycle-countdown__date--today\">3</span></div><div class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__day\"><span class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__dow\">T</span><span class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__date\">4</span></div><div class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__day\"><span class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__dow\">W</span><span class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__date x-flo-cycle-countdown__date--period\"><svg class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 50 50\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"25\" r=\"15.85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E23B61\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 4.15\"/></svg>5</span></div><div class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__day\"><span class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__dow\">T</span><span class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__date x-flo-cycle-countdown__date--period\"><svg class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 50 50\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"25\" r=\"15.85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E23B61\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 4.15\"/></svg>6</span></div><div class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__day\"><span class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__dow\">F</span><span class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__date x-flo-cycle-countdown__date--period\"><svg class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 50 50\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"25\" r=\"15.85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E23B61\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 4.15\"/></svg>7</span></div><div class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__day\"><span class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__dow\">S</span><span class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__date x-flo-cycle-countdown__date--period\"><svg class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 50 50\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"25\" r=\"15.85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E23B61\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 4.15\"/></svg>8</span></div><div class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__day\"><span class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__dow\">S</span><span class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__date x-flo-cycle-countdown__date--period\"><svg class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 50 50\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"25\" r=\"15.85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E23B61\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 4.15\"/></svg>9</span></div></div><div class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__label\">Period in:</div><div class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__count\">2 days</div><div class=\"x-flo-cycle-countdown__button\">Log period</div></div>",
   "css": ".x-flo-cycle-countdown{position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;width:393px;padding:16px 0;border-radius:24px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 328px 18px,rgba(196,150,140,0) 0,rgba(196,150,140,0.04) 200px,rgba(196,150,140,0.12) 290px,rgba(196,150,140,0) 305px),linear-gradient(180deg,#F8F0EE 0%,#FDFBFA 100%);font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:0;color:#000000;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap}\n.x-flo-cycle-countdown *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}\n.x-flo-cycle-countdown__week{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);margin:0 13px 0 15.3px}\n.x-flo-cycle-countdown__day{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}\n.x-flo-cycle-countdown__dow{height:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;line-height:8px;color:#7C7472}\n.x-flo-cycle-countdown__dow--today{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#000000}\n.x-flo-cycle-countdown__date{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:50px;height:50px;margin-top:12.7px;border-radius:50%;font-size:18px;line-height:1}\n.x-flo-cycle-countdown__date--today{background:#FFFFFF;font-size:18.6px;font-weight:700}\n.x-flo-cycle-countdown__date--period{color:#E23B61}\n.x-flo-cycle-countdown__ring{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;display:block;width:50px;height:50px}\n.x-flo-cycle-countdown__label{margin-top:81.8px;font-size:25.7px;font-weight:500;line-height:31px;letter-spacing:-0.03em}\n.x-flo-cycle-countdown__count{margin-top:8.1px;font-size:49.8px;font-weight:700;line-height:50px}\n.x-flo-cycle-countdown__button{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:139px;height:38.6px;margin:36.7px auto 0;border-radius:19.3px;background:#FE597D;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18.4px;font-weight:600;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.01em}",
   "fonts": [
    {
     "family": "Inter",
     "weight": 400
    },
    {
