   "backdrop": "#F8F0EE",
   "prompt": "Build a cycle countdown header like Flo's.\n- Layout: 393 x 317 pt, vertical gradient #F8F0EE to #FDFBFA.\n- Week strip: 7 columns on a 52 pt pitch. Weekday letters Inter 500, 11 pt, #7C7472; TODAY in Inter 700, #000000.\n- Day cells: 50 pt circles, 12.7 pt under the letters. Today: #FFFFFF circle, Inter 700, 18.6 pt. Plain day: Inter 400, 18 pt, #000000.\n- Predicted period day: #E23B61 digit in a 33 pt ring of 24 round 2 pt dots.\n- Countdown: Period in: in Inter 500, 25.7 pt, -0.03em, then 2 days in Inter 700, 49.8 pt, baselines 57 pt apart.\n- Button: 139 x 39 pt #FE597D pill, Log period in Inter 600, 18.4 pt, #FFFFFF, top 44 pt under the count baseline. Pressed: #E84E6F, scale 0.97.\n- Data rule: ring each predicted day and count the days to the first one. Roll the number up over 250 ms when it changes.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
  },
  {
