   "why": "Two of 3 arcs light up, green then orange, and an orange warning sign grades the result before the 2 words under it are read.",
   "html": "<div class=\"x-flo-pay-attention\"><svg class=\"x-flo-pay-attention__gauge\" viewBox=\"0 0 112.4 137.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"x-flo-pay-attention-g1\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" x1=\"15.86\" y1=\"70.09\" x2=\"24.46\" y2=\"26.25\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#65C16A\"/><stop offset=\"0.5\" stop-color=\"#99B947\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#C7B128\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"x-flo-pay-attention-g2\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" x1=\"29.01\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"80.44\" y2=\"0\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#E8AB12\"/><stop offset=\"0.3\" stop-color=\"#FEA100\"/><stop offset=\"0.53\" stop-color=\"#FE8A01\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#FD7B01\"/></linearGradient></defs><g fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M15.86 66.09A41.3 41.3 0 0 1 24.46 30.25\" stroke=\"url(#x-flo-pay-attention-g1)\"/><path d=\"M33.01 22.56A41.3 41.3 0 0 1 76.44 20.85\" stroke=\"url(#x-flo-pay-attention-g2)\"/><path d=\"M85.56 27.85A41.3 41.3 0 0 1 96.42 65.74\" stroke=\"#E6E6E6\"/></g><circle cx=\"56.1\" cy=\"55.9\" r=\"17\" fill=\"#FFF6E7\"/><path d=\"M56.2 48.1L62.6 60.9H49.8Z\" fill=\"#FFA900\" stroke=\"#FFA900\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M56.2 52.3V55\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"56.2\" cy=\"58.6\" r=\"1.2\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></svg><div class=\"x-flo-pay-attention__text\"><span class=\"x-flo-pay-attention__line\">Pay</span><span class=\"x-flo-pay-attention__line\">attention</span></div></div>",
   "css": ".x-flo-pay-attention{position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;width:112.4px;height:137.6px;border-radius:17.7px;background:#FFFFFF;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:700;line-height:20.4px;letter-spacing:0;color:#000000;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap}\n.x-flo-pay-attention *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}\n.x-flo-pay-attention__gauge{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;display:block;width:112.4px;height:137.6px}\n.x-flo-pay-attention__text{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:83.6px}\n.x-flo-pay-attention__line{display:block}",
   "fonts": [
    {
     "family": "Inter",
     "weight": 700
    }
   ],
   "size": {
    "w": 112,
    "h": 138
   },
   "backdrop": null,
   "prompt": "Build a severity gauge badge like Flo's.\n- Card: 112 x 138 pt, #FFFFFF, 17.7 pt corners.\n- Gauge: 3 arcs on one circle, radius 41.3 pt, center 57 pt from the top, 8 pt stroke, round caps, 5 degree gaps.\n- Arc angles, clockwise from 12 o clock: left 257 to 310, top 326 to 29.5, right 45.5 to 102.5 degrees.\n- Colors: left arc #65C16A to #C7B128 from bottom to top; top arc #E8AB12 to #FD7B01 from left to right; unlit arc #E6E6E6.\n- Center: 34 pt #FFF6E7 disc holding a 17 pt #FFA900 rounded triangle with a #FFFFFF exclamation mark.\n- Label: Pay attention, Inter 700, 16.5 pt, #000000, 2 centered lines on 20.4 pt, baselines 100 and 120 pt.\n- States: light the arcs left to right by level, 1 to 3. Level 3 adds #F2453D. Sweep each arc in 300 ms, then pop the triangle from 0.8 to 1.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
  },
  {
