   "backdrop": "#FFFFFF",
   "prompt": "Build a cycle month calendar like Flo's.\n- Grid: 393 pt wide on #FFFFFF, 7 columns of 50.9 pt, 5 rows of 54.3 pt, starting on a Monday.\n- Header: M T W T F S S, Inter 500, 11 pt, #E66483, 39 pt above row 1.\n- Days: Inter 400, 16.5 pt, #231318.\n- Period days 1 to 5: one #FFBFCD band, 41 pt tall, 8.3 pt corners, 20 pt past the end day centers.\n- Fertile days 12 to 18: the same band in #B3E4E8, split at the row break.\n- Ovulation day 17: solid 51.5 pt #1DA4A7 circle, Inter 700, 19.6 pt, #FFFFFF.\n- Prediction: a 120 pt #1DA4A7 circle in the empty cells, tied to day 17 by a 4.2 pt stem, with Prediction: Day of (9 pt) over ovulation (20 pt).\n- Motion: a tapped day scales from 0.8 to 1 in 200 ms; bands fade in by row, 150 ms each.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
  }
 ]
